 *      comment:		
 *      configuration:	 -instname RF1SH32x26 -words 32 -bits 26 -frequency 100 -ring_width 2 -mux 2 -drive 4 -write_mask off -wp_size 8 -top_layer met6 -power_type rings -horiz met3 -vert met2 -cust_comment "" -left_bus_delim "[" -right_bus_delim "]" -pwr_gnd_rename "VDD:VDD,GND:VSS" -prefix "" -pin_space 0.0 -name_case upper -check_instname on -diodes on -inside_ring_type GND -libname USERLIB
 *
 *      Synopsys model for Synchronous Single-Port Register File
 *
 *      Library Name:   USERLIB
